ing-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py#D:test_backend_http_error_subclasses_urllib_http_error\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:75-77\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:58-58\tBackendHTTPError remains a urllib HTTPError subtype so existing core catches still apply.\t39\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py#D:test_a_dc_404_is_classified_as_DELETED_by_the_real_differ\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:94-95\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:75-75\tThe outbound differ classifies a Data Center 404 as deleted.\t23\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py#D:test_a_dc_non_404_is_a_TRANSPORT_ERROR_not_a_DELETE\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:101-102\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:81-81\tA Data Center non-404 read failure is a transport error, never deletion.\t27\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py#D:test_cloud_classification_is_unchanged\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:109-111\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_exception_contract_heldout.py:88-88\tCloud 404 and other HTTP failures retain their pre-adapter classifications.\t32\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-