ram_typing_cc77.py:88-88\tOnly the runtime conformance guard may keep a deliberate Any transport parameter.\t44\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\ndialectal-fleeting-catfish\ttests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_param_typing_cc77.py#D:test_the_port_is_importable_from_any_core_module_without_a_cycle\t10fd0737eb7394804a63d0a779b3676c21296bb0:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_param_typing_cc77.py:129-135\t255f977212c05404d2a4771ef63435e6dd9febe8:tests/unit/reconciler/test_transport_param_typing_cc77.py:101-101\tEvery core module can import TicketTransport without a cycle or unresolved type.\t53\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792818267170694950,"uuid":"d7f3d016-d01b-45ad-a546-284d79ac1d5a"}